{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04590","headline":"游龙山静胜寺 · 张说","name":"游龙山静胜寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"每上襄阳楼，遥望龙山树。\n郁茀吐冈岭，微蒙在烟雾。\n下车岁已成，饰马闲余步。\n苦霜裛野草，爱日扬江煦。\n云对石上塔，风吹松下路。\n禅室宴三空，神祠同六趣。\n儿童共戏谑，猿鸟相惊顾。\n南识桓公台，北望先贤墓。\n世上人何在，时闻心不住。\n但传无尽灯，可使有情悟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04590.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04590","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}